MID_SE_Led_Asw_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_001: Impressive, Leda. May I train by your side?
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_002: Of course—but I would have thought your skills were\nalready honed enough for a queen.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_003: No. I'll be striding into battle as well. One can never\ntrain too much for that.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_004: Besides, I'm nowhere near you in artistic skill.\nAt least let me try to match you in archery.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_005: You've had a crown on your head all this time,\nand you're still as competitive as ever.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_006: But fine! I won't turn down a little competition.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_007: You're accurate with your arrows—it's satisfying\nto see.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_008: As for you, you let them loose with glorious power.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_009: You're really going to praise the skills of your\nbeloved's future assassin?
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_010: I'm sure Bertrand has resigned himself to\ngetting shot.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_011: Besides! I'm depending on your bow skills more than\njust about anything.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_012: What do you mean by that?
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_013: A long time ago, we saw each other as enemies.\nBut now we face a common foe.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_014: Bertrand is a hard man to kill. Anyone intent on\ndoing it anyway will make a promising ally.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_015: Hehe. You think that highly of me, huh?\nAnd him.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_016: Well, that's fine. I like your spirit.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_017: Thank you. And...Leda, may I ask you something?
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_018: What? You're acting stiff.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_019: We are holding a banquet soon. Would you consider\nattending?
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_020: I'm still upset about what happened at the last one\nI invited you to. I wanted to make up for it.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_021: I'll be sure to have your favorite foods prepared.\nAnd you can invite your friends too—
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_022: Sorry, but I'll pass. I wouldn't want something to\nhappen again.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_023: Of course. I suppose you wouldn't fully trust me after\nwhat happened.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_024: Well! I wouldn't mind if it was just the two of us.\nHow about you buy me something at the tavern?
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_025: You never repaid me for the meal I bought you after\nwe met.
MID_SE_Led_Asw_C_026: Oh! I suppose you're right, Leda. The tavern it is!